<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Every user-facing string the composable layer renders. Extracted in one
  pass (item #9) so the app can be translated by adding a values-<lang>/
  twin of this file. Names are <screen>_<meaning>; the common_ group is
  copy shared across screens.

  Deliberately NOT here (the phase-2 boundary, in ui code on purpose):
  ViewModel-authored text (validation hints, operation feedback, export
  labels), the spoken TalkBack sentence builders, Format's unit suffixes,
  the CSV/PDF/HTML exporters, and notification text. Those need design
  changes (resource-aware seams), not find-and-replace, and are recorded
  as the remaining work if translation actually ships.
-->
